INFO 2026-05-22 17:05:08,730 chat_sync.sync [request_id=C4B1D83A-FB31-4C0C-B9A7-7E68CAF359E0] chat push payload request_id=C4B1D83A-FB31-4C0C-B9A7-7E68CAF359E0 user_id=5 content_type=application/json body={"messages":[{"thread_id":"138592ff-1928-4442-aaf8-bd7c81185070","role":"assistant","model_name":"agent-FCFEE9BD-F7D3-4BCE-B622-65659D07ECCE","client_message_id":"aa5e994d-c069-4c52-91d4-734ddc1807cb","delivery_state":"sending","created_at":"2026-05-22 17:04:53.327000+00:00","server_updated_at":"2026-05-22 17:05:07.833000+00:00","tombstone":false,"thread_current_model_name":"agent-FCFEE9BD-F7D3-4BCE-B622-65659D07ECCE","thread_temperature":0.6,"thread_top_p":1.0,"thread_max_tokens":14096,"thread_max_messages":20,"thread_role_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}","blocks":[{"created_at":"2026-05-22T17:05:07.660Z","node_role":"timeline","id":"15688868-E6B1-5FBC-965D-AA648509A83D","payload":{"text":{"_0":"好的，我帮您从这4份报告中筛选与血脂相关的。让我逐一查看它们的详细内容。"}},"revision":1779469507659562,"order_key":1000,"status":"ready","updated_at":"2026-05-22T17:05:07.660Z"},{"created_at":"2026-05-22T17:05:07.658Z","node_role":"tool","id":"94E3CDC9-20F9-5557-9288-A69B316C7C75","tool_call_id":"call_00_8gFcf5ZGZS8bDVqa01qA7448","payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"content":"{\"reference\":{\"resource_id\":108,\"resource_type\":\"examination_report\",\"member_id\":19},\"version\":1,\"context_text\":\"【本轮用户引用的已保存健康资料（仅供解读，勿当作新上传附件）】\\n[1] 医疗报告\\n医疗报告\\n机构：苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）\\n类别：laboratory\\n指标：\\n· 总胆红素(TBIL): 13.5  \\n· 直接胆红素(DBIL): 4.2  \\n· 间接胆红素(IBIL): 9.3  \\n· 天门冬氨酸氨基转移酶(AST): 13.5  \\n· 丙氨酸氨基转移酶(ALT): 14.6  \\n· 总蛋白(TP): 77.0  \\n· 白蛋白(ALB): 47.4  \\n· 球蛋白(GLOB): 29.6  \\n· 白球比(A/G): 1.6  \\n· γ-谷氨酰转肽酶(GGT): 19.9  \\n· 碱性磷酸酶(ALP): 75.9  \\n· 前白蛋白(PA): 287.0  \\n· 尿素(UREA): 5.14  \\n· 肌酐(CREA): 77.50  \\n· 尿酸(UA): 324.6  \\n· 胱抑素C(CysC): 0.76  \\n· 空腹血糖(GLU): 5.42  \\n· 肌酸激酶(CK): 104.3  \\n· 乳酸脱氢酶(LDH): 168.0  \\n· α-羟丁酸脱氢酶(HBDH): 140.4  \\n· 胆碱酯酶(CHE): 11124  \\n· 甘油三酯(TG): 0.70  \\n· 总胆固醇(TC): 5.07  \\n· 高密度脂蛋白胆固醇(HDL-C): 1.51  \\n· 低密度脂蛋白胆固醇(LDL-C): 3.51  \"}","name":"get_health_resource_context"}}},"revision":1779469507768304,"order_key":2000,"status":"ready","updated_at":"2026-05-22T17:05:07.768Z"},{"updated_at":"2026-05-22T17:04:58.243Z","anchor":{"type":"toolCall","value":"call_00_8gFcf5ZGZS8bDVqa01qA7448"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T17:04:58.243Z","node_role":"toolPresentation","id":"035D4C72-49B7-5367-AD9C-D6DEF09DBB28","tool_call_id":"call_00_8gFcf5ZGZS8bDVqa01qA7448","parent_block_id":"94E3CDC9-20F9-5557-9288-A69B316C7C75","payload":{"health_resource_reference":{"_0":{"type":"health_resource_reference","resource_id":108,"member_id":19,"resource_type":"examination_report","ref_index":1}}},"revision":1779469498243295,"order_key":2100,"parent_tool_call_id":"call_00_8gFcf5ZGZS8bDVqa01qA7448","status":"ready"},{"payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"name":"get_health_resource_context","content":"{\"version\":1,\"reference\":{\"resource_type\":\"examination_report\",\"resource_id\":107,\"member_id\":19},\"context_text\":\"【本轮用户引用的已保存健康资料（仅供解读，勿当作新上传附件）】\\n[1] 医疗报告\\n医疗报告\\n机构：苏州工业园区星塘医院\\n类别：imaging\\n指标：\\n· 医疗报告: 头颅CT平扫脑实质未见明显异常，各脑室形态大小正常，中线结构居中，小脑及脑干未见异常。鼻咽顶后壁软组织增厚。颈椎生理曲度平直，椎体缘骨质增生，C4/5、C5/6椎间盘稍向后突出，相邻硬膜囊稍受压，骨性椎管无明显狭窄。两侧颈部、颌下区多发小淋巴结。右侧声带相对稍厚。  \"}"}}},"node_role":"tool","id":"3AB42B99-C596-56EA-9DEC-6F55DA5E191E","updated_at":"2026-05-22T17:05:07.800Z","revision":1779469507800433,"created_at":"2026-05-22T17:05:07.658Z","tool_call_id":"call_01_0RxzrPcp5nedBOic1oJk4527","status":"ready","order_key":4000},{"payload":{"health_resource_reference":{"_0":{"member_id":19,"resource_id":107,"ref_index":2,"type":"health_resource_reference","resource_type":"examination_report"}}},"parent_tool_call_id":"call_01_0RxzrPcp5nedBOic1oJk4527","node_role":"toolPresentation","id":"D2CC1A37-77CC-5754-ABC3-88BA127E62FD","parent_block_id":"3AB42B99-C596-56EA-9DEC-6F55DA5E191E","updated_at":"2026-05-22T17:04:58.432Z","revision":1779469498431743,"created_at":"2026-05-22T17:04:58.432Z","anchor":{"type":"toolCall","value":"call_01_0RxzrPcp5nedBOic1oJk4527"},"tool_call_id":"call_01_0RxzrPcp5nedBOic1oJk4527","status":"ready","order_key":4100},{"tool_call_id":"call_02_I56WqyIvQhPpmP7L5XRO0162","revision":1779469507828854,"node_role":"tool","id":"BC3C5545-6237-5998-82CB-BEBE0B9658C8","order_key":6000,"payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"content":"{\"context_text\":\"【本轮用户引用的已保存健康资料（仅供解读，勿当作新上传附件）】\\n[1] 医疗报告\\n医疗报告\\n机构：苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）\\n类别：imaging\\n医生：健\\n指标：\\n· 医疗报告: 食管通过顺利，黏膜大致正常；贲门开合佳通畅；胃底黏膜正常；胃体见胆汁残留；胃角光整；胃窦黏膜红白相间，以红为主；幽门圆，开放好；十二指肠球部及降部未见明显异常  \",\"reference\":{\"resource_id\":106,\"resource_type\":\"examination_report\",\"member_id\":19},\"version\":1}","name":"get_health_resource_context"}}},"status":"ready","created_at":"2026-05-22T17:05:07.658Z","updated_at":"2026-05-22T17:05:07.829Z"},{"tool_call_id":"call_02_I56WqyIvQhPpmP7L5XRO0162","id":"50F3D03F-BB15-5D4D-9320-7ECADADDCEC2","node_role":"toolPresentation","parent_tool_call_id":"call_02_I56WqyIvQhPpmP7L5XRO0162","parent_block_id":"BC3C5545-6237-5998-82CB-BEBE0B9658C8","revision":1779469498564421,"anchor":{"value":"call_02_I56WqyIvQhPpmP7L5XRO0162","type":"toolCall"},"payload":{"health_resource_reference":{"_0":{"resource_id":106,"ref_index":3,"type":"health_resource_reference","member_id":19,"resource_type":"examination_report"}}},"status":"ready","order_key":6100,"created_at":"2026-05-22T17:04:58.564Z","updated_at":"2026-05-22T17:04:58.564Z"},{"tool_call_id":"call_03_2mjfquFQGC8YsKCgBZCF4503","revision":1779469507830971,"node_role":"tool","id":"BC51F30E-F695-52CB-9FC0-0D6B0B352D95","order_key":8000,"payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"content":"{\"reference\":{\"resource_id\":103,\"member_id\":19,\"resource_type\":\"examination_report\"},\"version\":1,\"context_text\":\"【本轮用户引用的已保存健康资料（仅供解读，勿当作新上传附件）】\\n[1] 医疗报告\\n医疗报告\\n机构：苏州大学附属第四医院\\n类别：laboratory\\n指标：\\n· WBC: 5.56  \\n· RBC: 4.74  \\n· HGB: 141  \\n· PLT: 270  \\n· hs-CRP: 0.93  \"}","name":"get_health_resource_context"}}},"status":"ready","created_at":"2026-05-22T17:05:07.658Z","updated_at":"2026-05-22T17:05:07.831Z"},{"tool_call_id":"call_03_2mjfquFQGC8YsKCgBZCF4503","id":"239E9216-956E-55B8-ACE2-7ED6E42EA839","node_role":"toolPresentation","parent_tool_call_id":"call_03_2mjfquFQGC8YsKCgBZCF4503","parent_block_id":"BC51F30E-F695-52CB-9FC0-0D6B0B352D95","revision":1779469498699218,"anchor":{"value":"call_03_2mjfquFQGC8YsKCgBZCF4503","type":"toolCall"},"payload":{"health_resource_reference":{"_0":{"resource_type":"examination_report","ref_index":4,"resource_id":103,"type":"health_resource_reference","member_id":19}}},"status":"ready","order_key":8100,"created_at":"2026-05-22T17:04:58.699Z","updated_at":"2026-05-22T17:04:58.699Z"},{"id":"15688468-E6B1-58F0-965D-9E64850993D9","revision":1779469507705828,"node_role":"timeline","order_key":9000,"payload":{"text":{"_0":"找到了！在4份报告中，**第1份（2026年5月22日，苏州大学附属第四医院）** 包含完整的血脂相关指标。以下是您血脂结果的详细解读：\n\n---\n\n## 🔬 血脂四项 | 2026年5月22日 · 苏州大学附属第四医院\n\n| 指标 | 您的结果 | 参考范围 | 状态 |\n|------|----------|----------|------|\n| **甘油三酯 (TG)** | 0.70 mmol/L | <1.70 | ✅ 正常 |\n| **总胆固醇 (TC)** | 5.07 mmol/L | <5.18 | ✅ 正常偏高 |\n| **高密度脂蛋白 (HDL-C)** | 1.51 mmol/L | >1.04 | ✅ 良好 |\n| **低密度脂蛋白 (LDL-C)** | 3.51 mmol/L | <3.37 | ⚠️ 偏高 |\n\n---\n\n### 📊 综合解读：\n\n- **甘油三酯** 非常理想，说明脂肪代谢状况良好。\n- **高密度脂蛋白（\"好胆固醇\"）** 处于较好水平，对心血管有保护作用。\n- **低密度脂蛋白（\"坏胆固醇\"）** 略高于参考值上限（3.37），这是需要关注的信号。LDL-C 偏高会增加动脉粥样硬化风险。\n- **总胆固醇** 处于正常范围的上沿，主要也是受 LDL-C 偏高拉动的。\n\n### 💡 建议：\n\n目前只是轻度偏高，可以先通过生活方式调整：\n- 减少饱和脂肪摄入（肥肉、黄油、油炸食品等）\n- 增加膳食纤维（燕麦、蔬菜、水果）\n- 保持规律运动，每周至少150分钟中等强度有氧运动\n- 建议3-6个月后复查血脂\n\n---\n\n其他三份报告分别是头颅CT、胃镜和血常规，不涉及血脂项目。需要我帮您解读其中某一份吗？"}},"status":"ready","created_at":"2026-05-22T17:05:07.660Z","updated_at":"2026-05-22T17:05:07.660Z"}]}],"block_updates":[]}
