C2CB58-5914-561C-9F64-A2B5848CF0A4","status":"ready"},{"payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"name":"list_member_health_sources","invocation_arguments":{"limit":"10","resource_type":"examination_report"},"content":"【系统】成员已确定为 member_id=20（会话绑定或上文 JSON）。本轮勿再调用 request_member_selection、find_member；find_member 仅用姓名或关系检索，禁止把数字 ID 当作 name。\n【系统】用户已在客户端确认 3 份资料为本次解读范围。candidates 仅含勾选条目。请仅对这些 resource_type + resource_id 各调用一次 get_health_resource_context 获取解读正文（勿再调用 get_health_resource_reference，勿解读未列出资料）。\n{\"version\":1,\"member_id\":20,\"candidates\":[{\"title\":\"医疗报告\",\"occurred_at\":\"2026-05-22\",\"member_id\":20,\"resource_type\":\"examination_report\",\"resource_id\":112,\"match_reason\":\"符合当前筛选\",\"matched_fields\":[],\"confidence\":0.88,\"institution\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\"},{\"title\":\"医疗报告\",\"occurred_at\":\"2026-05-22\",\"member_id\":20,\"resource_type\":\"examination_report\",\"resource_id\":111,\"match_reason\":\"符合当前筛选\",\"matched_fields\":[],\"confidence\":0.88,\"institution\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\"},{\"title\":\"医疗报告\",\"occurred_at\":\"2026-05-22\",\"member_id\":20,\"resource_type\":\"examination_report\",\"resource_id\":113,\"match_reason\":\"符合当前筛选\",\"matched_fields\":[],\"confidence\":0.88,\"institution\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\"}],\"query\":{\"limit\":10,\"resource_type\":\"examination_report\"},\"truncated\":false}"}}},"revision":1779478685559928,"node_role":"tool","created_at":"2026-05-22T19:38:05.435Z","tool_call_id":"call_01_btg5TXfN3fAQzHUHL7Jy0428","order_key":4000,"updated_at":"2026-05-22T19:38:05.560Z","id":"65A9A81F-21E7-58B8-ACAD-45D496DDF1D4","status":"ready"},{"created_at":"2026-05-22T19:38:05.435Z","tool_call_id":"call_02_uwZkSUJuE39VlWAf87ld5331","status":"ready","payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"content":"当前成员：石头，关系：self，member_id：20。","name":"get_current_member"}}},"order_key":6000,"id":"C993F009-45D6-5121-A8F8-4BD8DF6B2FA7","updated_at":"2026-05-22T19:38:05.562Z","revision":1779478685561891,"node_role":"tool"},{"created_at":"2026-05-22T19:38:05.438Z","payload":{"text":{"_0":"好的，找到了1份体检报告（2025年9月）和3份复查医疗报告（2026年5月）。让我获取详细内容。"}},"status":"ready","order_key":7000,"id":"7338193A-ED4F-5476-A77F-B782BF8C050F","updated_at":"2026-05-22T19:38:05.438Z","revision":1779478685438870,"node_role":"timeline"},{"created_at":"2026-05-22T19:38:05.435Z","tool_call_id":"call_00_lWL09t8wYxZhqErvtQtq0197","status":"ready","payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"invocation_arguments":{"resource_id":"3","resource_type":"health_exam_report"},"content":"【系统】成员已确定为 member_id=20（会话绑定或上文 JSON）。本轮勿再调用 request_member_selection、find_member；find_member 仅用姓名或关系检索，禁止把数字 ID 当作 name。\n{\"context_text\":\"机构：苏州美健奥亚健康体检中心\\n日期：2025年9月14日\\n1、右下肺实性结节，Lung-RADS2 依据影像特征，结节为“良性表现或良性变化”，人群罹患率约45%；建议12个月做低剂量胸部CT筛查，呼吸科随诊。2、肺内纤维灶 多为肺部炎症愈合后遗留的纤维化疤痕。纤维化范围小基本不影响呼吸功能，范围广可导致肺功能降低。建议定期复查胸部CT和肺功能，伴有呼吸道症状时请呼吸科就诊。3、肥胖(体重指数 30.7 kg/m²) 热量摄入多于消耗所致，是高血压、高血脂、高血糖和高尿酸的重要危险因素。建议控制膳食总量，低脂、低糖饮食，同时增加新鲜蔬菜和水果在膳食中的比重，逐渐增加规律的有氧运动，达成3～6个月之内至少降低体重5%～15%并维持的目标。4、肝内钙化灶 多为肝脏组织局灶性创伤、炎症、寄生虫感染等病变愈合后钙盐沉着，也可为肝内胆管壁部分钙化。建议定期复查肝胆超声，伴有肝区不适等症状时请肝胆科随诊。5、正常高值血压:(128/71mmHg) 血压正常高值也具有一定的心脑血管事件风险。建议低盐饮食、不要吸烟和饮酒、适量运动，定期监测血压，预防高血压的发生。6、中性粒细胞百分数减低:40.8%(参考区间:50-70)，嗜酸性粒细胞百分数增高:8.4%(参考区间:0.50-5.00)，淋巴细胞百分数增高:45.0%(参考区间:20.00-40.00)，建议您结合病史和症状定期复查血常规，如有明显异常请内科就诊。\\n指标：\\n· 右下肺实性结节: 右下肺实性结节，大小约5mm×4mm，边界清，Lung-RADS2  异常\\n· 体重指数: 30.7 kg/m² ↑ 参考 18.5~23.9\\n· 嗜酸性粒细胞百分数: 8.4 % ↑ 参考 0.50-5.00\\n· 淋巴细胞百分数: 45.0 % ↑ 参考 20.00-40.00\\n· 中性粒细胞百分数: 40.8 % ↓ 参考 50-70\\n· 肝内钙化灶: 肝内可见斑点状强回声，后伴声影  异常\\n· 肺内纤维灶: 右肺中叶可见少许纤维条索影，边界清  异常\\n· 空腹血糖: 5.32 mmol/L  参考 3.89-6.11\\n· 糖链抗原19-9: 3.750 U/mL  参考 0-24\\n· 游离前列腺特异性抗原: 0.410 ng/mL  参考 0-1\\n· 总前列腺特异性抗原: 0.730 ng/mL  参考 0-4\\n· 甲胎蛋白（定量）: 1.480 ng/mL  参考 0-7.29\\n· 癌胚抗原（定量）: 0.700 ng/ml  参考 0-5\\n· 血清尿酸: 422.90 umol/L  参考 210-430\\n· 血清低密度脂蛋白胆固醇: 2.31 mmol/L  参考 ≤3.37\\n· 血清高密度脂蛋白胆固醇: 1.14 mmol/L  参考 ≥1.04\\n· 血清甘油三酯: 1.17 mmol/L  参考 ≤2.3\\n· 血清总胆固醇: 3.77 mmol/L  参考 ≤5.71\\n· 舒张压: 71 mmHg  参考 60-89\\n· 收缩压: 128 mmHg  参考 90-139\",\"version\":1,\"reference\":{\"member_id\":20,\"resource_type\":\"health_exam_report\",\"resource_id\":3}}","name":"get_health_resource_context"}}},"order_key":8000,"id":"F3F30E00-1136-517E-8440-105D9B733226","updated_at":"2026-05-22T19:38:05.564Z","revision":1779478685563772,"node_role":"tool"},{"status":"ready","revision":1779478661178297,"payload":{"health_resource_reference":{"_0":{"member_id":20,"resource_type":"health_exam_report","resource_id":3,"ref_index":1,"type":"health_resource_reference"}}},"parent_tool_call_id":"call_00_lWL09t8wYxZhqErvtQtq0197","anchor":{"value":"call_00_lWL09t8wYxZhqErvtQtq0197","type":"toolCall"},"tool_call_id":"call_00_lWL09t8wYxZhqErvtQtq0197","id":"39543A77-E7EC-52BB-B907-5DFDED1F62EA","order_key":8100,"created_at":"2026-05-22T19:37:41.178Z","updated_at":"2026-05-22T19:37:41.178Z","node_role":"toolPresentation","parent_block_id":"F3F30E00-1136-517E-8440-105D9B733226"},{"status":"ready","revision":1779478685566548,"payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"content":"【系统】成员已确定为 member_id=20（会话绑定或上文 JSON）。本轮勿再调用 request_member_selection、find_member；find_member 仅用姓名或关系检索，禁止把数字 ID 当作 name。\n{\"version\":1,\"reference\":{\"resource_type\":\"examination_report\",\"resource_id\":112,\"member_id\":20},\"context_text\":\"医疗报告\\n机构：苏州大学附属第四医院\\n类别：imaging\\n医生：报告确认者\\n指标：\\n· 医疗报告: 心率 59bpm ↓  \"}","name":"get_health_resource_context","invocation_arguments":{"resource_type":"examination_report","resource_id":"112"}}}},"order_key":10000,"id":"763C1937-B2F1-5C0B-B05F-3CA25E8C1E3D","tool_call_id":"call_01_QY5VjSfEL6lLJ5Umb68M6031","updated_at":"2026-05-22T19:38:05.567Z","created_at":"2026-05-22T19:38:05.435Z","node_role":"tool"},{"status":"ready","revision":1779478661333274,"payload":{"health_resource_reference":{"_0":{"resource_id":112,"ref_index":2,"member_id":20,"type":"health_resource_reference","resource_type":"examination_report"}}},"parent_tool_call_id":"call_01_QY5VjSfEL6lLJ5Umb68M6031","anchor":{"value":"call_01_QY5VjSfEL6lLJ5Umb68M6031","type":"toolCall"},"tool_call_id":"call_01_QY5VjSfEL6lLJ5Umb68M6031","id":"A21E367C-B9DD-5A91